<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>----------PURGE EQUIPMENT DELETED ON THE SERVER---------- #</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>Every row the server sent carries this run's stamp. Anything older was</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>deleted in the office, and a tech looking at equipment that no longer</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>exists wastes a site visit.</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>Rows with pending edits are never purged. The guard at the top already</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>refuses to run while any exist, so this is belt and braces -- but the</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>belt is what stops a download destroying a day's work.</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Value><Calculation><![CDATA[ExecuteSQL ( "select \"__ID\" from \"CUSTOMER_EQUIPMENT\" where ( \"z_lastDownload\" is null or \"z_lastDownload\" <> ? ) and ( \"f_pendingSync\" is null or \"f_pendingSync\" <> 1 )" ; "" ; "" ; $runStamp )]]></Calculation></Value><Repetition><Calculation><![CDATA[1]]></Calculation></Repetition><Name>$stale</Name></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="141" name="Set Variable"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Value><Calculation><![CDATA[0]]></Calculation></Value><Repetition><Calculation><![CDATA[1]]></Calculation></Repetition><Name>$purged</Name></Step>
